msgid "This site remembers the products a visitor viewed in a cookie named product_view_history_for_woocommerce. It holds product IDs, the price and stock status the product had at that moment, and the time of the view, and it lasts 30 days. For logged-in customers the same list is also saved in their account so it can follow them across devices; it is included in personal data exports and removed by erasure requests. The site also keeps an anonymous view counter per product, which is not linked to any visitor."
